WEBVTT

00:00:00.440 --> 00:00:04.560
Episode 24

00:00:00.440 --> 00:00:04.560
Deadly Battle<i>!
</i>Oh God, Mourn{Lament} For {Over}Gamilus<i>!!</i>

00:00:00.440 --> 00:00:04.560
( Air date: Mar 16, 1975 )

00:00:35.790 --> 00:00:40.150
Space Battleship

00:00:35.790 --> 00:00:40.150
<i>YAMATO</i>

00:01:44.850 --> 00:01:47.400
Analyzer, it's very important.

00:01:47.400 --> 00:01:51.200
Report the composition of the air
and seawater based on your analysis.

00:01:51.650 --> 00:01:57.180
It's strong acid, similar to sulfuric
acid. It will corrode any metal.

00:01:57.510 --> 00:02:02.690
Kodai, look. The third bridge fell off.
The bottom of the ship is corroded.

00:02:02.690 --> 00:02:03.530
Bombs, incoming !

00:02:06.630 --> 00:02:08.780
Descend, Shima !
Descend and turn !

00:02:23.460 --> 00:02:28.020
Damn, they're trying to force us into
the sea of acid with bombs from above.

00:02:40.390 --> 00:02:45.710
On March 27th, 2200, the Yamato was above
the sea of the home planet of Gamilus.

00:02:45.710 --> 00:02:49.640
{CHIKKYUU}It's in the Large Magellanic Cloud, and it's
located at 148,000 light years from Earth.

00:02:49.640 --> 00:02:54.050
{SOKO}One of the twin planets, Gamilus,
attacked Earth with meteor bombs...

00:02:54.050 --> 00:02:59.050
{SOKO}...and the resulting radioactive contamination
will drive mankind to extinction in one year.

00:02:59.050 --> 00:03:02.670
{HOUSYAHOU}A radiation purifier is on
the other twin planet, Iscandar.

00:03:02.980 --> 00:03:06.200
{CHIKYUU}The space battleship Yamato, the first
Earth ship to exceed the speed of light...

00:03:06.200 --> 00:03:09.960
{CHIKYUU}...has left for Iscandar to obtain
the radioactive contamination purifier.

00:03:15.560 --> 00:03:18.050
{DATA}However, just before the
Yamato arrived at Iscandar...

00:03:18.050 --> 00:03:19.990
{DATA}...they were captured inside
the planet Gamilus.

00:03:22.160 --> 00:03:29.040
{GAMILUS}Gamilus is an old planet, and the inside was
weathered over a long period of time.

00:03:29.040 --> 00:03:34.070
{CHIKAKU}The geosphere is sulfurizing and poisonous sulfurous acid is accumulating like suppuration.

00:03:34.750 --> 00:03:36.700
{KONO}Due to the sulfurous lava...

00:03:36.700 --> 00:03:40.300
{KONO}...the sea of Gamilus is composed of
strong acid, which melts any metal.

00:03:41.000 --> 00:03:43.200
{YAMATO}The Yamato is trapped.

00:03:49.910 --> 00:03:55.750
The 3rd base will start bombing.
Then, the 7th base. Two hits.

00:03:55.750 --> 00:03:57.850
The Yamato is
turning to 12 o'clock.

00:03:58.210 --> 00:03:59.960
6th base, attack.

00:03:59.960 --> 00:04:01.030
A hit on the port side.

00:04:01.030 --> 00:04:02.730
The 6th base will
drop all its bombs.

00:04:03.160 --> 00:04:06.650
It's too weak. Our enemy is the Yamato,
and this is the final battle on the mainland.

00:04:06.650 --> 00:04:08.270
{UTTE}Shoot and shoot until
you're out of ammunition.

00:04:08.270 --> 00:04:10.100
{YAMATO}Create a storm of
fire on the Yamato.

00:04:13.560 --> 00:04:18.840
The sulfuric acid storm is artificially created
by atmospheric pressure manipulators.

00:04:27.610 --> 00:04:31.050
Good.
Boil in the sea of acid.

00:04:31.050 --> 00:04:33.910
I'll shoot down the Yamato, 
and cook it till nothing remains.

00:04:33.910 --> 00:04:37.730
My Lord, the situation is favorable.
Would you like to take a break ?

00:04:40.050 --> 00:04:43.110
I'm fighting a war,
Vice President.

00:04:43.110 --> 00:04:47.770
Don't interrupt my most enjoyable
moment with some tasteless drink.

00:04:56.490 --> 00:04:57.640
Hang in there, Yuki.

00:04:58.110 --> 00:05:00.330
What'll happen to
the Yamato, Kodai ?

00:05:01.120 --> 00:05:03.320
I don't know.
Maybe we're finished.

00:05:03.940 --> 00:05:06.780
Don't give up.
This is a critical moment.

00:05:09.940 --> 00:05:10.950
This is Kodai.

00:05:10.950 --> 00:05:12.310
Come in.

00:05:16.350 --> 00:05:22.780
Kodai, how is the situation ?
You seem to be having a tough time.

00:05:22.780 --> 00:05:25.050
Captain, please give
me your advice.

00:05:25.050 --> 00:05:28.600
I...I don't know
what to do. Please.

00:05:29.050 --> 00:05:34.050
I see.  Well then,
let me give you some.

00:05:34.050 --> 00:05:35.400
Dive into the sea.

00:05:37.640 --> 00:05:39.960
Into the sea of acid ?

00:05:39.960 --> 00:05:41.060
Yes.

00:05:41.060 --> 00:05:42.640
The Yamato will corrode.

00:05:42.640 --> 00:05:45.460
It won't melt away
in 5 or 10 minutes.

00:05:45.460 --> 00:05:49.500
Find the streak before it melts, and
shoot it with the wave motion gun.

00:05:49.500 --> 00:05:51.090
You said streak ?

00:05:51.090 --> 00:05:55.560
{KYOSAN}Even if it's a sea of strong acid,
it must have been clean before.

00:05:55.560 --> 00:06:00.690
{SORE}It must be an underground sulfurous
volcano which changed the sea.

00:06:00.690 --> 00:06:06.200
{SOKO}Shoot that streak to induce massive
volcanic activity on the surface.

00:06:06.200 --> 00:06:09.520
{KOUGEKI}I think that's the only way to find an
opportunity for a counterattack.

00:06:09.520 --> 00:06:11.240
I see. I'll do it.

00:06:11.240 --> 00:06:13.600
Don't forget, finish
before the ship melts.

00:06:14.600 --> 00:06:15.600
Yes, sir.

00:06:20.220 --> 00:06:22.450
What ?
An undersea operation ?

00:06:22.450 --> 00:06:24.530
Yes.
We'll submerge. Hurry.

00:06:24.530 --> 00:06:28.350
That's insane. The ship will corrode. Don't
you remember that the third bridge fell off ?

00:06:28.350 --> 00:06:30.050
Of course I do.

00:06:30.050 --> 00:06:32.940
The hatches to the third bridge
were closed, weren't they ?

00:06:32.940 --> 00:06:35.600
Yes. It's temporary,
but it's secure...

00:06:35.600 --> 00:06:38.450
...and it can withstand the pressure,
just like the outer armor.

00:06:38.450 --> 00:06:39.670
Then it'll be alright.

00:06:39.670 --> 00:06:42.650
Analyzer, use everything you've got to
find the active underground mountains.

00:06:42.650 --> 00:06:45.070
As soon as you find it,
we'll fire the Wave Motion Gun.

00:06:45.070 --> 00:06:46.300
Let's go.

00:06:46.300 --> 00:06:48.380
All hands, execute
undersea operations.

00:06:49.290 --> 00:06:51.290
All hands, execute
undersea operations.

00:06:54.100 --> 00:06:55.490
Engine, nominal.

00:06:55.490 --> 00:06:57.840
Port damage is
temporarily repaired.

00:06:57.840 --> 00:06:59.050
Begin diving.

00:07:11.600 --> 00:07:13.060
The Yamato has submerged.

00:07:14.390 --> 00:07:17.260
The Yamato lost all of its strength,
and it's going to commit suicide ?

00:07:17.260 --> 00:07:19.600
Cease bombardment. We'll watch.

00:07:36.450 --> 00:07:38.690
10 o'clock. 10 o'clock.

00:07:39.090 --> 00:07:41.520
10 o'clock.
Steady.

00:07:45.620 --> 00:07:48.330
How is it ?  Have you found
a streak of strong acid ?

00:07:49.160 --> 00:07:52.180
What's wrong ?  Hurry up !
We don't have much time left !

00:07:52.690 --> 00:07:54.750
2 o'clock.
2 o'clock.

00:08:10.390 --> 00:08:11.670
4 o'clock.

00:08:11.670 --> 00:08:13.520
4 o'clock. Steady.

00:08:14.530 --> 00:08:16.050
Not yet, Analyzer ?

00:08:17.650 --> 00:08:18.360
Found it !

00:08:18.810 --> 00:08:19.950
Shima, stop !

00:08:21.340 --> 00:08:22.160
Stopping.

00:08:27.230 --> 00:08:30.850
A volcanic chain is going
from 12 o'clock to 6 o'clock.

00:08:30.850 --> 00:08:34.350
Estimated thickness
of the crust is 16 km.

00:08:34.940 --> 00:08:36.550
Prepare to fire the
Wave Motion Gun !

00:08:37.160 --> 00:08:40.720
Target is SE25 NW50.
Distance 12,000.

00:08:41.230 --> 00:08:42.690
Hurry !  We only
have 5 more minutes !

00:08:53.160 --> 00:08:54.650
Energy charge, 95 %.

00:08:58.140 --> 00:08:59.520
Energy charge, 100 %.

00:09:00.280 --> 00:09:01.610
All hands,
prepare for shock.

00:09:08.520 --> 00:09:10.160
Energy charge, 120 %.

00:09:11.890 --> 00:09:15.440
Target error
correction SE1205.

00:09:16.210 --> 00:09:17.280
Fire !

00:10:55.000 --> 00:10:56.200
That Yamato...

00:11:04.110 --> 00:11:05.950
Yamato has done it.

00:11:11.570 --> 00:11:13.250
He's lost his mind.

00:11:13.450 --> 00:11:14.480
That Yamato...

00:11:48.670 --> 00:11:50.490
The Yamato has reappeared.

00:11:52.380 --> 00:11:53.730
Continue bombing ?

00:11:54.890 --> 00:11:57.600
Yes, of course.
No, wait.

00:11:57.600 --> 00:11:59.080
Switch to
missile attack.

00:11:59.080 --> 00:12:02.950
Shoot all the missiles from
the roof cities at the Yamato.

00:12:05.400 --> 00:12:08.050
The current position of the Yamato
is 2500 meters below sector 3.

00:12:08.050 --> 00:12:10.010
Sector 3,
missiles are ready.

00:12:10.010 --> 00:12:11.440
Sector 4 is ready.

00:12:11.440 --> 00:12:13.230
Sector 5 is ready.

00:12:13.230 --> 00:12:15.000
The Yamato is advancing.

00:12:15.000 --> 00:12:16.750
Sector 6 is ready.

00:12:17.890 --> 00:12:20.200
We're in a tough situation,
but so they are.

00:12:20.200 --> 00:12:23.790
Victory will come to the
one who fights better.

00:12:23.790 --> 00:12:26.330
Everyone, just
one more push.

00:12:29.810 --> 00:12:33.000
My Lord, please stop.

00:12:33.000 --> 00:12:33.980
Say what ?

00:12:34.980 --> 00:12:39.420
Don't you realize it ?
Even great Gamilus can lose.

00:12:39.420 --> 00:12:43.460
Further combat is suicidal !
Please, stop !

00:12:43.460 --> 00:12:49.050
And even if it's too late, please seek the
way of peace and coexist with the Earth...

00:12:49.050 --> 00:12:49.990
My Lord.

00:13:05.460 --> 00:13:09.030
Port side armor is damaged.
Starboard observatory room corroded.

00:13:10.290 --> 00:13:13.460
All teams, rush repairs
for each section.

00:13:18.370 --> 00:13:20.470
Incoming missiles !
They're huge !

00:13:39.750 --> 00:13:42.300
Open all guns
and intercept.

00:14:08.950 --> 00:14:10.320
Turret 3 damaged.

00:14:10.320 --> 00:14:12.940
Shima, forward at full speed !

00:14:12.940 --> 00:14:15.380
Charge into the center
of the enemy. Move it !

00:18:13.050 --> 00:18:17.800
There was no city left,
only the ruins.

00:18:18.440 --> 00:18:23.490
After such total destruction,
nothing made a sound. Nothing moved.

00:18:24.900 --> 00:18:29.100
Kodai realized that one of the
planets in space had just died.

00:18:49.690 --> 00:18:53.140
What have we done ?

00:18:55.630 --> 00:18:59.420
I can't face God.

00:19:01.950 --> 00:19:07.400
We've been told to compete
and win since childhood.

00:19:08.400 --> 00:19:14.670
{GAKKOU}During school or at work,
we're expected to compete and win.

00:19:14.670 --> 00:19:21.420
{SHIKASHI}But there are losers behind the winners.
What happens to the losers ?

00:19:21.420 --> 00:19:26.670
{MAKETA}The losers don't have the right to be happy ?
I never thought about that, until now.

00:19:26.670 --> 00:19:29.320
{ORE}I'm sad, and frustrated
to realize it so late.

00:19:34.380 --> 00:19:40.210
{GAMILUS}The people of Gamilus wanted to immigrate.
This planet would've died anyway.

00:19:41.570 --> 00:19:46.630
{CHIKYUU}There's no difference between the people
of Earth or Gamilus in hoping for happiness.

00:19:48.020 --> 00:19:51.400
{NANONI}But we fought.

00:19:54.700 --> 00:19:58.240
{WAREWARE}We weren't meant to fight...

00:20:00.650 --> 00:20:03.050
{WAREWARE}...we were meant
to love each other.

00:20:03.050 --> 00:20:04.820
Victory...?

00:20:06.070 --> 00:20:07.300
Bullshit !

00:20:34.120 --> 00:20:37.130
Yuki, let's go to Iscandar.

00:20:37.130 --> 00:20:38.670
That's all we can do.

00:21:10.400 --> 00:21:11.340
Kodai !

00:21:14.060 --> 00:21:17.680
You're all alive.
Let's go to Iscandar.

00:21:22.040 --> 00:21:23.220
All ahead flank.

00:21:24.400 --> 00:21:27.190
Activate the main engine.
Ascend slowly.

00:22:14.370 --> 00:22:16.460
To the crew
of the Yamato...

00:22:16.460 --> 00:22:19.780
...to the crew of the Yamato,
Captain Okita speaking.

00:22:19.780 --> 00:22:22.750
We have arrived at Iscandar.

00:22:22.750 --> 00:22:26.310
Look.  Iscandar is right
before your eyes.

00:22:32.220 --> 00:22:37.020
Let me take this opportunity
to tell you one thing.

00:22:37.020 --> 00:22:38.440
Thank you.

00:22:38.740 --> 00:22:39.690
That's all.

00:23:02.020 --> 00:23:07.530
The Yamato has completed a
journey of 148,000 light years...

00:23:07.530 --> 00:23:11.020
{mokutekichi}...and it's approaching its
destination, the planet Iscandar.

00:23:11.020 --> 00:23:14.740
Now, Yamato, retrieve the
radioactive contamination purifier.

00:23:14.740 --> 00:23:19.490
The people on Earth are
desperately awaiting your return.

00:23:19.490 --> 00:23:22.850
Hurry, Yamato, your long
journey hasn't ended yet.

00:23:22.850 --> 00:23:26.740
Mankind will be
extinct in 161 days.

00:23:27.200 --> 00:23:31.620
Mankind will be
extinct in 161 days.

00:23:30.490 --> 00:23:37.650
161 days left until the destruction of Earth

00:23:39.450 --> 00:23:44.680
Okita Juzo:

00:23:39.450 --> 00:23:44.680
Naya Goro

00:23:44.960 --> 00:23:50.180
Mori Yuki:

00:23:44.960 --> 00:23:50.180
Asagami Yoko

00:23:50.470 --> 00:23:55.690
Desler:

00:23:50.470 --> 00:23:55.690
Ibu Masayuki

00:23:55.990 --> 00:24:05.490
Note:
The narrator says, March 27th, but it's actually April 28th. Did they consider the broadcasting date of March 16, which is closer ?

00:24:05.490 --> 00:24:15.490
Note:
In episode 23, both Analyzer and Desler referred to the ocean as strong sulfurous acid, but in this episode, it was changed to the sea of strong acid.

00:24:15.490 --> 00:24:25.490
Note:
Desler moved from the palace to the command center (The Desler) on the ceiling of the outer crust. Was Starsha able to send
her message during that time ?

00:24:32.020 --> 00:24:38.620
Translation

00:24:32.020 --> 00:24:38.620
Editing

00:24:38.620 --> 00:24:46.190
Timing

00:24:38.620 --> 00:24:46.190
Song Translations

00:24:46.190 --> 00:24:51.140
